# Optional local-development Gemini credential for the current browser-side Agent Herald path.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite exposes every VITE_-prefixed variable to browser code. This value is
# therefore browser-visible by design and MUST NOT be treated as a protected deployment
# secret. Use only a deliberately scoped development credential. Shared/production model
# credentials require a separately reviewed server/API boundary.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
